    "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:40:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-27T11:40:51Z",
    "body": "I think we should preserve `usages` even if we set `isRange` to true. In the typical case we expect the report descriptor will have either min/max usages or a list of usages but not both. But including both isn't disallowed by the report descriptor format, so we should expect that a report item could have both. Since the actual intent is ambiguous, we should include all the information provided by the report descriptor and let the application decide how to interpret it.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
